      "title": "Subharmonicon Manual",
      "notes": "MIDI CC table (pages 41, 42, 43) read by tools/profiles/moog/read-moog-pdf.mjs from Subharmonicon_Manual AMZ.pdf (sha256 c79ffe2d4fbcb48a5763ad2e937f7ea7bc712f33c2a6e7173377ab6576bf4a65), https://cdn.inmusicbrands.com/Moog/Subharmonicon/Subharmonicon_Manual%20AMZ.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
