  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/moog/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/moog/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI tables, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "No identity check: the manual prints no Device Inquiry reply.",
    "6 knob(s) are printed as an MSB and an LSB, 0 - 16383 together; CEditor sends the MSB alone, 0 - 127, which the manual says the instrument takes by itself: VCO 1 Frequency (CC 4, LSB 36); VCO 2 Frequency (CC 12, LSB 44); VCF (EG) ATTACK (CC 23, LSB 55); VCF (EG) DECAY (CC 24, LSB 56); VCA (EG) ATTACK (CC 28, LSB 60); VCA (EG) DECAY (CC 29, LSB 61)."
  ],
